```{=html}
<table class="sched materials">
<thead><tr><th class="sched-date">Date</th><th>Topic</th><th>Files</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<% for (const r of items) { if (!r.materials) continue; %>
<tr class="sched-row" data-iso="<%= r.iso %>">
<td class="sched-date"><%= r.day %></td>
<td class="sched-topic"><%= r.topic %></td>
<td class="sched-mat"><% for (const m of r.materials) { %><a href="<%- m.href %>"><%= m.label %></a><% } %></td>
</tr>
<% } %>
</tbody>
</table>
```
